# Fit outputs. Lenses, checkpoints and convergence traces belong under
# $JLENS_ARTIFACT_ROOT / $JLENS_SCRATCH_ROOT, never in the repo. fit_lens.py's
# --out_dir defaults to ./out, so this catches an accidental in-repo run.
out/
*.pt
*_convergence.csv

# NOT ignored: the resolved dependency lock. T3 commits it deliberately -- it is
# what makes a fit re-derivable.
